{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"x":0.081123946054282858,"c":1,"h":0.019150396924989876,"y":0.063099220124157251,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.10591819763183594},{"t":"RYAN:","x":0.08117619798477714,"h":0.010895070368964976,"c":1,"w":0.036609541575113938,"y":0.11446525548725128},{"t":"MADDY:","y":0.12889095343170665,"w":0.050470317204793294,"x":0.081166225618760371,"h":0.01256693018492161,"c":1},{"y":0.14680232541991056,"c":1,"x":0.083044982568457923,"h":0.0087209305119230196,"w":0.0346020762125651,"t":"RYAN:"},{"t":"MADDY:","h":0.011865554446520044,"x":0.081276162135659746,"w":0.050250444412231449,"y":0.16121838544993028,"c":1},{"y":0.17855128492813621,"t":"RYAN.","h":0.0091764998652870133,"x":0.082969245880710793,"w":0.036483653386433917,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"x":0.081314879429098375,"w":0.05017300923665366,"t":"MADDY:","y":0.20930232536095228},{"y":0.24127906991272885,"c":1,"h":0.010174418263205087,"w":0.03806228319803874,"t":"RYAN:","x":0.081314879075721103},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"t":"MADDY:","y":0.28924418583950418,"w":0.05017300923665366,"x":0.081314879381302441},{"c":1,"w":0.03806228319803874,"t":"RYAN:","x":0.08131487942174187,"y":0.31976744152887293,"h":0.011627907349230915},{"x":0.083044982236728043,"c":1,"w":0.04844290733337403,"h":0.010174418263205198,"y":0.35174418619511627,"t":"MADDY:"},{"x":0.083044981930475117,"w":0.036332181294759125,"c":1,"t":"RYAN:","y":0.39970930246952963,"h":0.010174418263205198},{"w":0.046768086751302076,"y":0.43159589006991506,"h":0.010354731448302346,"t":"MADDY:","c":1,"x":0.084747444430552196},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"t":"RYAN:","x":0.083044983227970229,"y":0.47819767408701253,"w":0.03806228319803874},{"t":"MADDY:","h":0.011627907349230804,"x":0.083044983310267065,"w":0.050173009236653646,"y":0.51017441836555366,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418263205198,"c":1,"t":"RYAN:","x":0.084775085745809303,"y":0.55813953502766911,"w":0.036332181294759111},{"t":"MADDY:","y":0.590116279221649,"c":1,"x":0.084775086035991432,"w":0.04844290733337403,"h":0.010174418263205087},{"c":1,"x":0.08477508573670349,"y":0.60610465130928881,"w":0.036332181294759111,"h":0.010174418263205198,"t":"RYAN:"},{"c":1,"h":0.013353475913707835,"y":0.63649186656213608,"x":0.084723433776433793,"w":0.048546212514241543,"t":"MADDY:"},{"h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1,"x":0.084775087542423661,"y":0.66860465087964827,"w":0.036332178115844715,"t":"RYAN:"},{"y":0.11046511635134171,"x":0.16435986799187774,"t":"Shall we talk about some of the semi-synthetic new fabrics now?","h":0.015988371937820434,"w":0.44809687296549472,"c":1},{"y":0.12790697649885185,"w":0.11937716166178386,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"OK, let's do that.","x":0.16608996577899948},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.36505190531412757,"t":"Let's start with Lyocell, I've been reading about that.","c":1,"x":0.16435986050241677,"y":0.14240727799391606},{"y":0.15697674439963483,"w":0.5051902770996094,"t":"Yeah, that's the one produced from the pulp of eucalyptus trees, isn't it?","h":0.017441859689102501,"c":1,"x":0.16435988013531641},{"c":1,"t":"Yes, and what happens with that is really impressive. Over 99% of dissolving","y":0.17152706453160671,"w":0.53131998697916671,"x":0.16426559908177787,"h":0.02050411259068563},{"t":"agents used in the manufacturing process are used again.","x":0.1642798175526741,"y":0.18945460738780606,"w":0.40497411092122404,"h":0.017018318843641356,"c":1},{"t":"Yeah. Now, there are a few semi-synthetic fabrics that I'd never heard of. Like","c":1,"h":0.018056188787589744,"x":0.16430380454398119,"w":0.53990422566731766,"y":0.20460515389548706},{"c":1,"w":0.14359862009684243,"x":0.16608996321436492,"y":0.22238372068747303,"t":"Cupro, for example.","h":0.014534884186538477},{"c":1,"t":"Made from byproducts of the cotton industry to create a kind of vegan silk.","x":0.16430206546745921,"y":0.23594530905586186,"w":0.52779403686523441,"h":0.018801733861860459},{"w":0.53308420817057289,"y":0.25140284630311183,"t":"But I'm not sure how sustainable this really is as there are so many reports of","h":0.018712757182671846,"x":0.16773691180500408,"c":1},{"w":0.33217992146809894,"c":1,"x":0.16608997144588131,"t":"pollution caused by the manufacturing process.","y":0.26889534902952894,"h":0.014534882851794828},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"x":0.16435985831232414,"t":"Mmm. It doesn't compare favourably with all the other sustainable fabrics we've","y":0.28481455592367877,"w":0.56055363972981775},{"x":0.16435986193007807,"t":"looked at, no.","w":0.10207612355550133,"y":0.30230930694967451,"h":0.01309766962947001,"c":1},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.31686046487972885,"t":"Bamboo is one fabric we're all familiar with. But I didn't know that it was only","c":1,"x":0.16608996399546735,"w":0.53806228637695308},{"y":0.33275017494071002,"h":0.016095171448565537,"x":0.16608997088470989,"c":1,"t":"organic bamboo that's truly sustainable.","w":0.28200691223144531},{"h":0.016157217005735802,"c":1,"x":0.16608995333638707,"y":0.347383720999759,"w":0.55017303466796874,"t":"Me neither. Apparently, the manufacturing process for a significant proportion"},{"x":0.16435986977696757,"t":"of bamboo is chemically quite intensive - which obviously can be quite","h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.36482558115989239,"w":0.49480967203776038,"c":1},{"h":0.015021159316877752,"x":0.16602794073375679,"t":"damaging.","y":0.38202430403983356,"w":0.079708824157714853,"c":1},{"x":0.16608995453006165,"c":1,"y":0.39534883692539524,"t":"EcoVero is an example of a semi-synthetic fabric which is becoming really","w":0.51211074829101566,"h":0.017527299965070187},{"w":0.059675286610921224,"t":"popular.","y":0.41285450909744803,"h":0.014672898011578006,"x":0.165571618969266,"c":1},{"w":0.55200581868489584,"y":0.42655712862630768,"h":0.018021541512704964,"c":1,"t":"Probably because manufacturing causes 50 percent fewer emissions and takes","x":0.16602339091368037},{"y":0.44174202054872846,"x":0.16771478419176503,"w":0.54516454060872399,"h":0.017036215086096651,"t":"up half as much energy as conventional fabrics. That saves production costs as","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017778324530289935,"x":0.16596225603761969,"t":"well as being better for the environment.","y":0.45821287483757844,"w":0.28913228352864584},{"x":0.16608997289357802,"h":0.016121616723906107,"y":0.47515745296291767,"c":1,"w":0.54844289143880198,"t":"That's true. I think demand for cork will continue to grow. It works really well in"},{"x":0.16782006639131344,"c":1,"y":0.49265220401342769,"w":0.162629763285319,"h":0.013296011196641033,"t":"vegan shoes and bags."},{"y":0.50502949136917585,"w":0.54339080810546869,"x":0.16600395805216769,"h":0.019107874662747659,"c":1,"t":"Mmm and it's the only fabric that's fundamentally sustainable - the cork trees"},{"w":0.51557093302408863,"t":"it comes from are renewable and the product itself is both recyclable and","h":0.016097205597842112,"c":1,"y":0.52169349199047066,"x":0.16608996610961516},{"y":0.53809298417972395,"h":0.017536932142403261,"x":0.16768088614888663,"t":"biodegradable - which is unique.","w":0.23380126953124999,"c":1},{"h":0.020462304416280164,"c":1,"w":0.49161692301432292,"y":0.55202252559097831,"x":0.16768305264292963,"t":"And the harvesting process is actually good for the trees. There are no"},{"y":0.57122093035122401,"w":0.25605537414550783,"c":1,"h":0.01310377207730018,"t":"downsides to using this source at all.","x":0.16955016752874069},{"w":0.47923873901367181,"c":1,"t":"Hemp is another really good sustainable fabric from a natural source.","h":0.011713346957826665,"x":0.16955018057770327,"y":0.58712386252809945},{"y":0.59974072502400877,"h":0.018273954878660903,"w":0.53997309366861979,"c":1,"x":0.16599796405471484,"t":"Yes. Did you know that clothes made from hemp protect the wearer from the"},{"t":"sun and it's also antibacterial?","c":1,"x":0.16595222519313443,"y":0.61803935368949481,"w":0.21135236104329427,"h":0.015761456179235078},{"x":0.16776143908132932,"y":0.63204726084159579,"h":0.020315679492777017,"c":1,"t":"No, I didn't. But I did read that it's quite hard to grow, so perhaps that's why it's","w":0.55549153645833327},{"w":0.21681299845377602,"h":0.019847581568424921,"x":0.16750621046629108,"y":0.6485237009592747,"t":"not as common as you'd think.","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.66573803415609856,"t":"I'm sure that'll change.","x":0.16590247646480408,"w":0.1647530237833659,"h":0.016246345845697063},{"y":0.71785241906029584,"w":0.084857298533121739,"c":1,"h":0.014876557197330498,"t":"PART 4","x":0.086464084212739045},{"w":0.59861592610677083,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"t":"Today I'm going to talk about invasive species. Let me start by saying what an invasive","y":0.74562631200575435,"x":0.086505185856827566},{"c":1,"x":0.086436702898930851,"w":0.62470718383789059,"t":"species is and what it's not. Invasive species are any animal or plant that is introduced into","y":0.76058872535626787,"h":0.017078351607432762},{"x":0.08470844287431277,"t":"an environment by humans, and which is then harmful to that environment. It's important","y":0.77606330025177783,"w":0.62124409993489582,"c":1,"h":0.018291247817000089},{"t":"to be clear that not all introduced species are invasive. Many introduced - or non-native -","x":0.086505195243094454,"c":1,"h":0.013296011196640922,"w":0.62456746419270837,"y":0.79356193147854126},{"c":1,"y":0.8093637317629635,"h":0.016345008759335089,"w":0.37383125305175779,"x":0.086435351393408841,"t":"species thrive in new areas without posing any threat."},{"t":"In some cases, invasive species have changed the natural world beyond recognition, so let's look","y":0.82968941405079755,"h":0.018820159997532948,"x":0.084706521811446583,"w":0.64201863606770837,"c":1},{"x":0.084727999004586677,"c":1,"w":0.64541361490885418,"y":0.84615760002918172,"h":0.017732398671816862,"t":"at the different ways they can be problematic. First of all, invasive species may eat native species,"},{"t":"or sometimes they may bring a disease with them, which native species have never faced before","h":0.020150775255399433,"y":0.86078250411750568,"c":1,"x":0.086394771282842744,"w":0.63861918131510409},{"c":1,"y":0.8763130752645284,"w":0.6264714558919271,"x":0.084688348377256001,"h":0.0206765487863102,"t":"and therefore have no defences against. Often the invasive species breed very quickly - which"},{"w":0.63335296630859372,"c":1,"h":0.019030996767101516,"x":0.084710229838266524,"y":0.89284946554104838,"t":"further adds to the problem of native species losing their sources of food. Species invasions are"},{"t":"one of the biggest causes of damage in an ecosystem, actually putting its survival at risk.","w":0.58833185831705725,"c":1,"h":0.017904222887491605,"y":0.90972116583239604,"x":0.086451163127233457},{"x":0.086505191026509956,"y":0.96220930231892976,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"110"},{"t":"Q25","x":0.74740484479333036,"y":0.17441860473898774,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"y":0.28488372071338952,"t":"Q26","x":0.74740484479813629},{"t":"Q27","c":1,"x":0.747404844802942,"y":0.34883720908378257,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.011627907349230693},{"h":0.011627907349230915,"c":1,"x":0.7474048441601534,"w":0.034602076212565169,"t":"Q28","y":0.42732558117680575},{"t":"Q29","w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.74913494860436458,"y":0.50726744194615259,"c":1},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1,"t":"Q30","h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.74913494860917051,"y":0.60174418613433667},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"x":0.75086505241059298,"t":"Q31","y":0.86191860473685022},{"x":0.75086505242077006,"w":0.032871971130371103,"y":0.90988372101591997,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"Q32"}]}